  "raw_statement_html": "<td valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#FAFBCA\" class=\"cell_0\"> <p class=\"Basis\">На сторонах <a name=\"MTBlankEqn\"><span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg0.png\",\"\");</script></span></a>, <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg1.png\",\"\");</script></span> и <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg2.png\",\"\");</script></span> треугольника <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg3.png\",\"\");</script></span> отмечены точки <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg4.png\",\"\");</script></span>, <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg5.png\",\"\");</script></span> и <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg6.png\",\"\");</script></span> соответственно, причём <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg7.png\",\"\");</script></span>, <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg8.png\",\"\");</script></span>, <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg9.png\",\"\");</script></span>. Отрезки <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg10.png\",\"\");</script></span> и <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg11.png\",\"\");</script></span> пересекаются в точке <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg12.png\",\"\");</script></span>.</p>\n<p class=\"Basis\">а) Докажите, что четырёхугольник <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg13.png\",\"\");</script></span> — параллелограмм.</p>\n<p class=\"Basis\">б) Найдите радиус окружности, описанной около треугольника <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg14.png\",\"\");</script></span>, если отрезки <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg15.png\",\"\");</script></span> и <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg16.png\",\"\");</script></span> перпендикулярны, <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg17.png\",\"\");</script></span>, <span><script language=\"JavaScript\">ShowPictureQ(\"docs/AC437B34557F88EA4115D2F374B0A07B/questions/78B4A914F9D0A76644109F5812E864E6(copy1)/innerimg18.png\",\"\");</script></span>.</p> </td>",
  "statement_html": "<div><section> <p class=\"Basis\">На сторонах <a name=\"MTBlankEqn\"><span><img src=\"../assets/9ad4a0b46f956b6b251f681c.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span></a>, <span><img src=\"../assets/1fb4760b00369b473386d353.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span> и <span><img src=\"../assets/18f57dd309af928695c40d43.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span> треугольника <span><img src=\"../assets/9b8e63d21aa4ebadd88da812.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span> отмечены точки <span><img src=\"../assets/5549dce0263154fbd2dffe44.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span>, <span><img src=\"../assets/8f0caca357a9c39db05f93d2.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span> и <span><img src=\"../assets/540e000134a887f3cfac4b0e.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span> соответственно, причём <span><img src=\"../assets/dc7a8a730f310facdffc1fa3.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span>, <span><img src=\"../assets/2d0c8b288b838b345673bcdc.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span>, <span><img src=\"../assets/4530361533417d74413e16f5.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span>. Отрезки <span><img src=\"../assets/18e6714bf49175296eda7e6a.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span> и <span><img src=\"../assets/d2ec58e4ceacf4474f35aa78.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span> пересекаются в точке <span><img src=\"../assets/d292c2a3d74014f916429edd.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span>.</p>\n<p class=\"Basis\">а) Докажите, что четырёхугольник <span><img src=\"../assets/39bdc6c9e26290788fec4f75.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span> — параллелограмм.</p>\n<p class=\"Basis\">б) Найдите радиус окружности, описанной около треугольника <span><img src=\"../assets/846093f1b4b5cd3c10a03db9.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span>, если отрезки <span><img src=\"../assets/6a3e0e868f71fc2f79786dd9.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span> и <span><img src=\"../assets/2e6901233b8d2f58c8cec06f.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span> перпендикулярны, <span><img src=\"../assets/1a8ec0dfa92458003a72a2d3.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span>, <span><img src=\"../assets/02736ae659074ad2f5ad5cd6.png\" alt=\"Рисунок ФИПИ\"></span>.</p> </section></div>",
